00:03:48.530 --> 00:03:51.519
You're bombing innocent civilians using banned
munitions.

00:03:51.519 --> 00:03:57.659
You have a record your country does dropping
barrel bombs on people in Syria.

00:03:57.659 --> 00:04:02.150
You've destroyed checks nearby a massive war
