00:04:31.710 --> 00:04:34.400
You, my friend, are the one who needs to apologize.

00:04:34.400 --> 00:04:37.699
And when it comes to Putin, he needs to go
to jail.

00:04:37.699 --> 00:04:42.770
Speaker 1: OK, so toning it down very much
